        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The tax effect has been reflected in Accumulated Other Comprehensive Income (Account 219). See Notes 2 and 4 of Notes to Financial Statements for further discussion on the derivative instrument and hedging activities.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
